Labor Day | nth 1 mon 9 | us
Columbus Day, Indigenous Peoples' Day, Indigenous Peoples Day | nth 2 mon 10 | us
Halloween | fixed 10-31 | all
Veterans Day | fixed 11-11 | us
Armistice Day | fixed 11-11 | all
Election Day | nth 1 mon 11 +1 | us
Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day | nth 4 thu 11 | all
Black Friday | nth 4 thu 11 +1 | all
Cyber Monday | nth 4 thu 11 +4 | all
St Andrew's Day, St. Andrew's Day | fixed 11-30 | gb
Bonfire Night, Guy Fawkes Night, Guy Fawkes Day | fixed 11-05 | gb
Remembrance Sunday | nearest sun 11-11 | gb
Christmas Eve | fixed 12-24 | all
Christmas, Christmas Day, Xmas | fixed 12-25 | all
Boxing Day | fixed 12-26 | all
Leap Day | fixed 02-29 | all
Burns Night | fixed 01-25 | gb
Epiphany | fixed 01-06 | all
Mother's Day, Mothers Day | nth 2 sun 5 | us
Mothering Sunday, Mother's Day, Mothers Day | easter -21 | gb
Father's Day, Fathers Day | nth 3 sun 6 | all
Early May bank holiday | nth 1 mon 5 | gb
Spring bank holiday | nth last mon 5 | gb
Summer bank holiday | nth last mon 8 | gb
Shrove Tuesday, Pancake Day, Mardi Gras | easter -47 | all
Ash Wednesday | easter -46 | all
